{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "For your New Year's celebration at the restaurant, we have selected a striking grey dress with a zipper and button details, paired with chunky chocolate-colored lace-up boots to keep you warm against the frost. You can easily dress it down for an office day by adding the long cappuccino wool coat with its fur collar, or switch up your footwear if you prefer ankle boots in the same chocolate tone for a more classic look. The outfit is anchored by a white jacquard scarf featuring bold black graphic motifs, which adds a sophisticated touch to your ensemble.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Drape the scarf around your neck or shoulders as an accessory, letting its patterns peek out over the grey dress for a festive yet understated look."
  ],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#106·05",
      "text": "This is a fitted long-sleeve dress in a rich graphite tone with a central black zipper closure and contrasting dark buttons. The fabric has a soft texture, perfect for evening occasions, and the cut hugs your waist to highlight your shape while keeping you comfortable throughout the night."
    },
    {
      "n": "#268·39",
      "text": "A slim green leather belt with a polished silver-toned rectangular buckle. It features a pebbled texture on the outside and smooth brown leather on the inside, adding a modern metallic accent to your waistline when worn."
    },
    {
      "n": "#293·10",
      "text": "Sturdy chocolate-brown ankle boots made from natural-looking faux fur lining and genuine leather upper. They feature lace-up front detailing and a thick platform sole with visible stitching, offering both style and warmth for the winter weather."
    },
    {
      "n": "#370·27",
      "text": "A reversible jacquard scarf in white with intricate black graphic embroidery on one side. The fringed edges add movement, and the large-scale design brings an artistic flair to your outfit without overwhelming the grey tones."
    },
    {
      "n": "#123·03",
      "text": "A structured suede handbag in a soft beige tone with gold hardware accents. It includes a detachable circular pouch and features dual top handles, offering elegant functionality to carry your essentials effortlessly during the celebration."
    },
    {
      "n": "#100·04",
      "text": "A luxurious cappuccino-toned wool coat with a plush fur collar and a classic double-breasted silhouette. The long length and heavy fabric make it ideal for layering over your dress, providing warmth without compromising on elegance."
    }
  ]
}
